--       (h1 : iPre.val < 56) (h2 : iPost.val < 56) (h3 : iN.val < 56)
--       (d1 : iPre ≠ 37 ∧ iPre ≠ 39) (d2 : iPost ≠ 37 ∧ iPost ≠ 39) (d3 : iN ≠ 37 ∧ iN ≠ 39)
--       {pre post n' A : ℕ} {L1 L2 L3 : List ℤ}
--       (hG1 : F iPre = (pre : ℤ) :: L1) (hG2 : F iPost = (post : ℤ) :: L2) (hG3 : F iN = (n' : ℤ) :: L3)
--       (hpA : pre ≤ 2 ^ A) (hqA : post ≤ 2 ^ A) (hnA : n' ≤ 2 ^ A) (hA : 2 ≤ A) :
--       Sp (cntP iPre iPost iN) (encK s0 F) (encK s0 (cntOut F pre post n')) (30 * uC A DD)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** B-line IL, source-table producers, part 6: the table loop, pass 1, the counts
--
--   **Table loop** (`tab_loop`): `rep 43 (reg iN) b` with `n'` on `iN`, the body at step `k` (index
--   `j = n' - 1 - k`, i.e. `43` holds `j + 1`) pushing `argOf j` then `J6Seg.Slab.code (src j)` on `44`; the loop
--   leaves `srcTab src argOf n' ++ G 44` on `44` (the table is produced last entry first).
--   `enc_base`, `enc_base44`: rebasing the empty-`43` precondition away.
--
--   **Pass 1** (`selP iS iT iK iN`): `src = selSrc s t`, `argOf = fun _ => K` (the caller passes
--   `K = 2^(P'-p-1)` on `iK`), `n'` on `iN`.
--   Inputs: `s` on `iS`, `t` on `iT`, `K` on `iK`, `n'` on `iN` (all `Free`); `0 < s`,
--   `s, t, n' ≤ 2^A`, `|K| ≤ 2^A`, `2 ≤ A`. Output: `44 := srcTab (selSrc s t) (fun _ => K) n' ++ F 44`,
--   everything else unchanged (`43` is the loop counter, restored). Theorem `selP_sp`, cost
--   `(n' + 1) * (30 * uC A DD)`.
--
--   **Counts** (`cntP iPre iPost iN`): pushes `pre` on `37` (`rNB`), `2 post` on `39` (`rM`),
--   `pre * (n' * (2 post))` on `40` (`rTOT`). Inputs `pre` on `iPre`, `post` on `iPost`, `n'` on `iN`
--   (registers `< 56`, distinct from `37, 39, 40`), all `≤ 2^A`. Theorem `cntP_sp`.
